{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How hard can it be to retire on a dying planet? The future has been torn to shreds by those who hold it in their hydraulic claws.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scropia is a story-driven visual novel set on a planet colonized by mechanical life forms, featuring mini-games. This civilization, which briefly introduces itself as the Federation and rules nearly the entire planet with an iron fist, is rapidly approaching its end due to never-ending wars with biological life forms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scropia's story begins when the bot named Mether wakes up while being transported to a place called \u201cparadise\u201d for retirees via a kind of cable car line.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices will shape your destiny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Demo Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-No minigames</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-No real ending</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-The story is incomplete</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Some extra demo dialogue</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4037810?t=1762444387","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4037810?t=1762444387","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4037810/accb2e94319dee6f4bef717279e6241ed4af8d17/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762444387","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4037810/accb2e94319dee6f4bef717279e6241ed4af8d17/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762444387","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How hard can it be to retire on a dying 